description:
csv-repair: CSV Repair API: turns CSV a parser rejects into valid CSV without changing any cell - fixes quotes, pads short rows, unwraps Markdown tables, chat text and fences; 1,250 and 007 stay as written. No language model: an ambiguous row gets a paid CANNOT REPAIR verdict. $0.004 USDC per call (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"input": "string, required - up to 60000 chars", "line_endings": "lf|crlf, optional"}
